            </note>
            <note corresp="#d587-f2" n="67" xml:id="d587-f2-content">
                <p>A note, based on the recommendation in this memorandum, was addressed to the
                    Chilean Chargé on January 2, 1947 (825.6374/11-1846).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
